	(text "What this does: Lets the flight MCU read battery, flight-supply and recovery-arm voltages.\nConnects to: Three rails -> resistor dividers -> power-off signal switches -> flight ADC. Voltage readings are useful evidence, not permission to fire or proof of isolation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "146b8c26-5d92-5dc3-a870-eb3c8e761443")
	)
	(text "All four analog switches enable only with FLIGHT_3V3; the fourth (pins 11 / 12) is unused since the servos went (D-19Nov.2). Verify injection, leakage, settling and ADC calibration on the first PCBA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 307.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "63ae8caf-5b76-597e-a846-92ea0de4b66b")
	)
	(text "RAIL VOLTAGE DIVIDERS / UNPOWERED ADC BOUNDARY"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "88c28c32-ddb7-5f57-ae1d-e96ef1f27526")
	)
	(text "Recovery-arm voltage is an evidence input. A low reading is not a physical isolation proof."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 320.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ec2e5979-4ec0-5378-b167-0f377ba018a6")
	)
	(text "Each ratio: 10k / (22.1k + 22.1k + 10k). Two top resistors preserve limiting resistance if one shorts."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 294.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f0d88b38-e73b-5244-9341-ebe20d9c43ff")
	)
